                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8bf36eac-9c60-3040-b5d3-a57b1f1cc755",
                        "entry_id": "b3b718ac-7d66-3ab9-bbb9-9439a4db0160",
                        "glosses": [
                            "cockroach"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b8dc64d-002e-4418-ba3a-e46680dc308b",
                                "sense_id": "8bf36eac-9c60-3040-b5d3-a57b1f1cc755",
                                "text": "«Я-то отдежу́рю и вы́йду отсю́да, а он весь свой тарака́ний век здесь продежу́рит, — поду́мал он, потя́гиваясь. — Тоска́! Сапоги́ себе́ почи́стить, что ли?»",
                                "translation": "\"When I am off duty I shall go away, but he'll be on duty here all his cockroach-life,\" he thought, stretching. \"I am bored! Shall I clean my boots?\"",
                                "english": "\"When I am off duty I shall go away, but he'll be on duty here all his cockroach-life,\" he thought, stretching. \"I am bored! Shall I clean my boots?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
